{"5412860":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Farmer's Daily","steam_appid":5412860,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you grow is who you become.<br>Farmer’s Daily is a farming survivor roguelite. Your fields are where your power comes from: which crops you plant and how much you harvest decide what kind of farmer you become each run.<br>Crops are your abilities<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 crops, each hiding its own ability that levels up the more you harvest<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a different mix of crops every run<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scent of your crops lures monsters in: the more you grow, the more come<br>Farm tools are your weapons<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 auto-attacking weapons, and every one of them can evolve<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchantments, 11 passives and 46 artifacts work with your crop abilities, so every run plays differently<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 kinds of drones collect, water, plant, harvest and defend for you<br>A colorful cast of monsters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 minions, 65 elites and 65 bosses, every boss with moves of its own<br>30-minute runs, stronger every time<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32 farmers, each with a different starting weapon and traits<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >64 permanent Farmhouse upgrades: build up your farm bit by bit with Season Seeds<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy, Normal, Hard and Hell difficulties, plus Endless mode once you win<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >97 achievements<br>About the art<br>This game has no artist. Every character, crop and monster is drawn by code, one stroke at a time. If it looks a little crooked and a little weird, that’s the style. Probably.<br>Available in 12 languages: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese (Brazil), Russian and Polish.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you grow is who you become.<br>Farmer’s Daily is a farming survivor roguelite. Your fields are where your power comes from: which crops you plant and how much you harvest decide what kind of farmer you become each run.<br>Crops are your abilities<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 crops, each hiding its own ability that levels up the more you harvest<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a different mix of crops every run<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scent of your crops lures monsters in: the more you grow, the more come<br>Farm tools are your weapons<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 auto-attacking weapons, and every one of them can evolve<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchantments, 11 passives and 46 artifacts work with your crop abilities, so every run plays differently<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 kinds of drones collect, water, plant, harvest and defend for you<br>A colorful cast of monsters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 minions, 65 elites and 65 bosses, every boss with moves of its own<br>30-minute runs, stronger every time<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32 farmers, each with a different starting weapon and traits<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >64 permanent Farmhouse upgrades: build up your farm bit by bit with Season Seeds<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy, Normal, Hard and Hell difficulties, plus Endless mode once you win<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >97 achievements<br>About the art<br>This game has no artist. Every character, crop and monster is drawn by code, one stroke at a time. If it looks a little crooked and a little weird, that’s the style. Probably.<br>Available in 12 languages: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese (Brazil), Russian and Polish.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"What you grow is who you become. Each of the 25 crops hides an ability that grows with every harvest, and what to plant is up to you. Farm for 30 minutes while auto-attacking tools hold off the swarms, and survive three bosses. All the art is drawn by code, hence the odd look. We know.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5412860\/cb4a806c3b102f06ec4451fcff3aa70ca8589a06\/header.jpg?t=1793091902","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5412860\/a1a20c38655fd4b9e39b2d1120e55cd8cff7389f\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793091902","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5412860\/a1a20c38655fd4b9e39b2d1120e55cd8cff7389f\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793091902","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-4590 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible GPU (Intel HD Graphics 520 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 700 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-12400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 5600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8192 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 \/ AMD Radeon RX 560<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 700 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":[